      "message": "Well, the size of 10 is not obligatory and can be reduced even to 1. The reason is that now this pool is used only to spawn a single green thread in which a wsgi server is running. \n\nIn case we have more than one worker, then the parent process would fork and each process would have its own copy of a pool. And this copy should not include any greenthread object as the spawn is done after the fork.\n\nSo, we can go with the size of 1 as I\u0027ve said. I\u0027ll make a change and add a comment.",
